# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible.
#
# node_modules especially: shipping the host's tree into the build would both
# bloat the context and risk platform-specific binaries built for a different
# OS than the image. `npm ci` installs them inside the container instead.
node_modules
dist
.astro

.git
.gitignore

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

README.md
*.log
